   "text": "1. Start: the opening plays once, then Connect wallet walks through Backpack step by step",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": -300,
   "page": "v7"
  },
  "v7row1": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7000,
   "text": "2. Home: wallet and margin at a glance, products as tiles, positions as a list",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1195,
   "page": "v7"
  },
  "v7row2": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7000,
   "text": "3. Perps: market → order → approve → confirmed, then manage the position (close or add collateral)",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2690,
   "page": "v7"
  },
  "v7row3": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7000,
