   "x": 0,
   "y": 8670,
   "page": "v7"
  },
  "v7row7": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 7000,
   "text": "8. When things go wrong: every action has a sad path. Not enough balance blocks the button with a clear reason; failed transactions say why (network, price moved, no SOL for fees, a step that did not finish) and offer a retry",
